~ museum
Espen Tannerla: This place used to be the manor of the Kamisvik family in the 17th century.
=> END

~ kamisvik
Espen Tannerla: The Kamisviks were a wealthy noble family who governed the region for a couple hundred years. 
Espen Tannerla: We don't really know for sure what happened to them. The only daughter of the last family died before 20.   
=> END

~ daughter
Espen Tannerla: Her name has been completely erased from the records. 
Espen Tannerla: We only know of her existence because of the family portrait.
=> END

